\x1b[79D\x1b[K\x1b[1;36m[ Bob TheDupe ]\x1b[0;37m (Old Guard)\r\nBob is a healthy, moderately built Human Warrior with short brown hair and\r\nhazel eyes.  He moves slugishly, and is charismatic and outgoing.  You can\'t\r\nhelp but like him.  Bob appears to be bright and seems to possess a wisdom\r\nbeyond his years.  He is unwounded.\r\n\x1b[33m\r\nHe is equipped with:\r\n\r\n\x1b[32m\x1b[32mpadded vest                    \x1b[36m(Torso)\r\n\x1b[32mtorch                          \x1b[36m(Readied)\r\n\x1b[32mquarterstaff                   \x1b[36m(Weapon Hand)\r\n\r\n
